The DUT is buggy: pulse should be din AND NOT previous, and previous should be updated to din. Let me write correct RTL.

Also note the port declaration: input clk, rst, din; output reg pulse. Keep exact interface.

Let me write:

module rising_edge(input clk, rst, din, output reg pulse);
reg previous;
always @(posedge clk) begin
  if (rst) begin
    previous <= 1'b0;
    pulse <= 1'b0;
  end else begin
    pulse <= din & ~previous;
    previous <= din;
  end
end
endmodule

That's the fix.

